lemma secret_k_gnb:
  all-traces
  "∀ p r #i #j.
    ((Secret( <'K_gNB', r> ) @ #i) ∧ (KeyDerived( <'K_gNB', r>, p ) @ #j)) ⇒
    (((¬(∃ #k. K( r ) @ #k)) ∨
      (∃ X #k. (Rev( X, <'K_gNB', r> ) @ #k) ∧ (Honest( X ) @ #i))) ∨
     (∃ X #k. (Rev( X, <'K_AMF', p> ) @ #k) ∧ (Honest( X ) @ #i)))"
/*
guarded formula characterizing all counter-examples:
"∃ p r #i #j.
  (Secret( <'K_gNB', r> ) @ #i) ∧ (KeyDerived( <'K_gNB', r>, p ) @ #j)
 ∧
  (∃ #k. (K( r ) @ #k)) ∧
  (∀ X #k. (Rev( X, <'K_gNB', r> ) @ #k) ∧ (Honest( X ) @ #i) ⇒ ⊥) ∧
  (∀ X #k. (Rev( X, <'K_AMF', p> ) @ #k) ∧ (Honest( X ) @ #i) ⇒ ⊥)"
*/
by sorry

